://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta","html_url":"https://github.com/AquilesCanta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"AquilesCanta","id":8539544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Mzk1NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8539544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta","html_url":"https://github.com/AquilesCanta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2020-07-27T09:42:10Z","updated_at":"2020-10-10T01:04:55Z","closed_at":"2020-08-10T09:51:59Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Searched documentation and issues\r\n* Code documentation of `HlsMediaSource`\r\n* Blog post about chunkless preparation: https://medium.com/google-exoplayer/faster-hls-preparation-f6611aa15ea6\r\n* Searched the issues here on Github for `chunkless`\r\n\r\n### Question\r\nAre there cases where an HLS manifest is complete and correct (with regards to the actual segment files) but chunkless preparation in ExoPlayer still fails? Conversely, if I _switch_ to `setAllowChunklessPreparation(true)` and there are _new_ playback problems is there always something wrong with either the manifest of the segment files (or at least a mismatch between the two)? Or are there \"legitimate\" cases where chunkless preparation fails but \"normal\" preparation works fine?\r\n\r\nThe current context is a stream where audio is played fine with \"normal\" preparation but the stream is played silently with chunkless preparation. (Also, from the logs I can see that no Decoder of type `C.TRACK_TYPE_AUDIO` is even enabled in this case). (Interestingly, this only happens when the app requests a manifest which contains only the highest of several available qualities. If the app requests the \"full\" manifest it can then later switch up to the highest quality and still continue playing the audio.)\r\n\r\n### A full bug report captured from the device\r\nIf you think it makes sense in this case I will provide a bug report log.\r\n\r\n### Link to test content\r\nCurrently, the relevant stream configuration is only available on the internal test network and under a dynamic URL. We are working on getting a test stream under a public and fixed URL.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"